msgctxt "176\t493561\t1\tCHK"
msgid "Hm, counterattacking after someone breaks your guard?"
msgstr "Hmm... ¿Contraatacar después de que te rompan la guardia?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493615\t2\tCHK"
msgid "Cheating out in the open like that? He deserves what he got."
msgstr "¿Engañándola tan descaradamente? Se lo tenía bien merecido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493676\t3\tCHK"
msgid "She used that narrow alleyway to her advantage."
msgstr "Sí que le sacó provecho a ese callejón tan estrecho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493724\t4\tCHK"
msgid "Nobody likes a cheater."
msgstr "A nadie le agradan los que son infieles."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493748\t5\tCHK"
msgid "Damn, she kicked clean through his guard."
msgstr "Vaya, atravesó su guardia con una patada perfecta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493790\t6\tCHK"
msgid "Is everyone 'round here some kinda kung fu master?"
msgstr "¿Es que aquí todos son maestros de artes marciales?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493841\t7\tCHK"
msgid "Those leaps and bounds were something else."
msgstr "Supongo que esos saltos no estuvieron mal."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493885\t8\tCHK"
msgid "What's with the suspenders?"
msgstr "¿Por qué lleva tirantes? No tiene camisa..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493913\t9\tCHK"
msgid "You know, that girl was actually kinda cute."
msgstr "Oye... la chica no estaba tan mal."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t493958\t10\tCHK"
msgid "Fancy-lookin' ride. Wonder if it's alright."
msgstr "Vaya carro más elegante. Espero que el tipo esté bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494002\t11\tCHK"
msgid "Guy slammed straight into the wall."
msgstr "El tipo ha ido directo contra la pared."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494038\t12\tCHK"
msgid "This hitman tryin' to off himself first?"
msgstr "¿Acaso este sicario se quiere matar antes que a su objetivo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494079\t13\tCHK"
msgid "Kidnappings sure are scary."
msgstr "Los secuestros son aterradores, desde luego."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494107\t14\tCHK"
msgid "I wonder what color they were..."
msgstr "Me pregunto de qué color eran..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494140\t15\tCHK"
msgid "Right in the jewels. That's gotta hurt."
msgstr "Justo en las pelotas. ¡Qué dolor!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494180\t16\tCHK"
msgid "She really gave him the ol' one-two."
msgstr "Le dió un buen golpe doble."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494217\t17\tCHK"
msgid "There's no escape when you're up on the roof."
msgstr "No se puede escapar cuando estás en el techo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494263\t18\tCHK"
msgid "Nice work, kid."
msgstr "Bien hecho, niño."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494279\t19\tCHK"
msgid "That's how it goes in the yakuza world."
msgstr "Así funciona el mundo de la Yakuza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494319\t20\tCHK"
msgid "Somethin' that heavy's sure to do damage."
msgstr "Algo así de pesado debe ser doloroso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494361\t21\tCHK"
msgid "Shoulda just rolled him in from the start."
msgstr "Debieron hacerlo rodar desde un principio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494404\t22\tCHK"
msgid "It wasn't his money to begin with."
msgstr "Para empezar, no era su dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494439\t23\tCHK"
msgid "Backwards between the legs?"
msgstr "¿Hacia atrás entre las piernas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494467\t24\tCHK"
msgid "Dang, that girl made a pretty nice catch."
msgstr "Maldita sea, esa chica hizo una cazada bastante buena."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494509\t25\tCHK"
msgid "Guy was probably tryin' to drink away his troubles."
msgstr "Probablemente intentaba ahogar sus penas en alcohol."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494561\t26\tCHK"
msgid "Brave man, goin' up against that young kid."
msgstr "Qué valiente ha sido enfrentando a ese joven."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494605\t27\tCHK"
msgid "The momentum helped him land a big hit."
msgstr "El ímpetu le permitió dar un buen golpe."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494645\t28\tCHK"
msgid "A strong hit after a taunt, huh?"
msgstr "Un golpe fuerte después de una burla, ¿eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494678\t29\tCHK"
msgid "A tie around the head... I should try it sometime."
msgstr "Un lazo alrededor de la cabeza... Debería intentarlo alguna vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494729\t30\tCHK"
msgid "More momentum means more power."
msgstr "Más impulso significa más potencia."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494761\t31\tCHK"
msgid "I don't think that's how it's supposed to work."
msgstr "No creo que sea así como se supone que debe funcionar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494809\t32\tCHK"
msgid "Hm, he hit one toy with the other to make it fall..."
msgstr "Hm, golpeó un juguete con el otro para hacerlo caer..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494862\t33\tCHK"
msgid "I wonder if I can do that, too."
msgstr "Me pregunto si yo también puedo hacer eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494894\t34\tCHK"
msgid "He was no match for the hustle and bustle of Kamurocho."
msgstr "No era rival para el ajetreo y el bullicio de Kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494950\t35\tCHK"
msgid "He got clocked hard when he was off guard..."
msgstr "Le dieron un duro golpe cuando estaba desprevenido..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176\t494995\t36\tCHK"
msgid "Karma's a bitch, huh?"
msgstr "El karma es una perra, ¿eh?"

